N0lGTHJlUGJ1Y28xUTZXeWtPUE10T09uNVp3LXBrWUpQYUFnQ1piVQ?oc=5","date":"2026-11-11","zh":"Chipotle 在 2026 年退伍軍人節向退伍軍人和軍事界提供免費籌碼和 DIP 優惠"}],"themes":[{"name":"半導體/晶片","count":18},{"name":"分析師評等","count":5},{"name":"國防/軍工","count":1},{"name":"訂單/合約","count":1}],"biz":{"tenk":{"form":"10-K","date":"2026-02-04","period":"2025-12-31","url":"https://www.sec.gov/Archives/edgar/data/1058090/000105809026000009/cmg-20251231.htm"},"overview":[{"en":"Chipotle Mexican Grill, Inc., a Delaware corporation, together with its subsidiaries (\"Chipotle,\" \"we,\" \"us,\" or \"our\") owns and operates Chipotle Mexican Grill restaurants, which feature a relevant menu of burritos, burrito bowls (a burrito without the tortilla), quesadillas, tacos, and salads. We strive to cultivate a better world by serving responsibly sourced, classically cooked, real food with wholesome ingredients and without artificial colors, flavors or preservatives. We are passionate about providing a great guest experience and making our food more accessible to everyone while continuing to be a brand with a demonstrated purpose. Our first Chipotle restaurant opened in Denver, Colorado in 1993. Over 30 years later, our devotion to seeking out high-quality ingredients, raised with respect for animals, farmers, and the environment, remains at the core of our commitment to Food wi","zh":"Chipotle Mexican Grill, Inc. 是一家特拉华州公司，与其子公司（“Chipotle”、“我们”、“我们”或“我们的”）拥有并经营 Chipotle Mexican Grill 餐厅，其特色菜单包括墨西哥卷饼、墨西哥卷饼碗（不含玉米饼的墨西哥卷饼）、墨西哥玉米饼、炸玉米饼和沙拉。我们致力于提供来源可靠、经过经典烹饪、采用有益健康成分、不含人工色素、香料或防腐剂的纯正食品，打造一个更美好的世界。我们热衷于提供卓越的宾客体验，让每个人都能更容易地享用我们的食物，同时继续成为一个具有明确目标的品牌。我們的第一家 Chipotle 餐廳於 1993 年在科羅拉多州丹佛市開業。 30 多年後，我們致力於尋找優質食材，尊重動物、農民和環境，這仍然是我們對食物和環境承諾的核心。"},{"en":"As of December 31, 2025, we owned 3,938 Chipotle restaurants throughout the United States (\"U.S.\") and 104 international Chipotle restaurants. Additionally, we had 14 international partner-operated restaurants. Partner-operated restaurants represent Chipotle restaurants over which Chipotle does not have a controlling financial interest and for which Chipotle does not directly manage day-to-day operations. This includes restaurants operated by third parties pursuant to license or franchise agreements and restaurants in which Chipotle holds a minority, non-controlling ownership interest. We manage our U.S. operations based on 11 regions and aggregate our operations to one reportable segment. Our revenue is derived from sales by our restaurants.","zh":"截至 2025 年 12 月 31 日，我們在美國（「美國」）擁有 3,938 家 Chipotle 餐廳和 104 家國際 Chipotle 餐廳。此外，我們還有 14 家國際合作夥伴經營的餐廳。合作夥伴經營的餐廳是指 Chipotle 沒有控股權且不直接管理日常營運的 Chipotle 餐廳。這包括由第三方根據許可或特許經營協議經營的餐廳以及 Chipotle 持有少數非控股所有權權益的餐廳。我們根據 11 個地區管理我們的美國業務，並將我們的業務匯總到一個可報告部門。我們的收入來自餐廳的銷售。"},{"en":"Chipotle is a brand with a demonstrated purpose of Cultivating a Better World. Our Recipe for Growth strategy leans into what uniquely differentiates Chipotle, with a focus on accelerating growth and sharpening competitiveness. The strategy is grounded in five key areas:","zh":"Chipotle 是一個以「創造更美好世界」為宗旨的品牌。我們的成長秘訣著重於 Chipotle 的獨特之處，重點是加速成長和提高競爭力。該戰略基於五個關鍵領域："}],"markets":[],"customers":[],"competition":[{"en":"The fast-casual, quick-service, and casual dining segments of the restaurant industry are highly competitive with respect to, among other things, taste, price, food quality and presentation, customer service, location, convenience, brand reputation, and cleanliness and ambience of each restaurant. Our competition includes a variety of restaurants in each of these segments, including locally-owned restaurants, as well as national and regional chains. Competition from food delivery services, which offer meals from a wide variety of restaurants, also has increased in recent years and is expected to continue to increase. Many of our competitors also offer dine-in, carry-out, online, catering, and delivery services. Among our main competitors are restaurant formats that claim to serve higher quality ingredients without artificial flavors, colors and preservatives, and that serve food quickly ","zh":"餐饮业的快速休闲、快速服务和休闲餐饮领域在口味、价格、食品质量和摆盘、客户服务、位置、便利性、品牌声誉以及每家餐厅的清洁度和氛围等方面竞争激烈。我們的競爭包括每個細分市場的各種餐廳，包括當地擁有的餐廳以及全國和地區連鎖餐廳。近年來，來自各種餐廳提供餐點的送餐服務的競爭也有所加劇，並且預計將繼續加劇。我們的許多競爭對手也提供內用、外帶、線上、餐飲和外送服務。我們的主要競爭對手包括聲稱提供更高品質食材、不含人工香料、色素和防腐劑並且快速提供食物的餐廳業態"},{"en":"\"Chipotle,\" \"Chipotle Mexican Grill,\" \"Food with Integrity,\" \"Responsibly Raised,\" \"Chipotle Rewards,\" and a number of other marks and related designs and logos are U.S. registered trademarks of Chipotle. We have filed trademark applications for a number of additional marks in the U.S. as well. In addition to our U.S. registrations, we have registered trademarks for \"Chipotle\" and a number of other marks in Canada, the European Union, the Middle East and various other countries, and have filed trademark applications for \"Chipotle Mexican Grill,\" \"Chipotle\" and a number of other marks in additional countries. We also believe that the design of our restaurants is our proprietary trade dress and have registered elements of our restaurant design for trade dress protection in the U.S. as well.","zh":"“Chipotle”、“Chipotle Mexican Grill”、“Food with Integrity”、“Responsively Raising”、“Chipotle Rewards”以及许多其他标志和相关设计和徽标是 Chipotle 在美国的注册商标。我們也在美國提交了許多其他標誌的商標申請。除了在美国注册之外，我们还在加拿大、欧盟、中东和其他国家注册了“Chipotle”商标和许多其他商标，并在其他国家/地区提交了“Chipotle Mexican Grill”、“Chipotle”和许多其他商标的商标申请。我们还认为，我们餐厅的设计是我们专有的商业外观，并已在美国注册了我们餐厅设计的元素，以实现商业外观保护。"}],"segments":{"prod":{"end":"2025-12-31","items":[{"name":"Food & Beverage","val":11866051000,"zh":"食品及飲料"},{"name":"Delivery Service","val":59550000,"zh":"送貨服務"}],"total":11925601000}},"peers":["SBUX","LULU","COST","CRM","NKE"]}}